{"_id":"wzly2aM8jNCApDC6","name":"Matrona","type":"npc","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/matrona.webp","items":[{"_id":"0it6DypGVsp31wTR","name":"+1 Status to All Saves vs Enchantment","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":100000,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":[],"selector":"saving-throw","type":"status","value":1}],"slug":"1-status-to-all-saves-vs-magic","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kquBnQ0kObZztnBc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"gxQBxPmLhYDPjfME","name":"Engineering Lore","type":"lore","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/lore.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"mod":{"value":27},"proficient":{"value":0}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"F6TbZXJojdI5WgK8","name":"Detach Soul","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The matrona takes 10 or more damage from a single attack or effect;</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> When a matrona's mother suit is damaged, the creatures whose souls compose these outer layers break free and, in a rage, attack the matrona's enemies.</p>\n<p>The matrona casts a 1st-level <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.hs7h8f4Z1ZNdUt3s]{Summon Fey}</em> spell. For every additional 10 damage the matrona took from the triggering attack or effect, the summon fey spell is heightened by 1 spell level, up to 7th level. For example, if the matrona took 30 damage, then it can cast summon fey heightened to 3rd level with this reaction; if the matrona took 54 damage, then it could cast summon fey heightened to 5th level.</p>\n<p>Each summoned fey lasts for 1 minute or until it is banished. The matrona doesn't need to sustain this effect, but each summoned fey still has only two actions. If using Detach Soul would cause the matrona to have more than three summoned fey simultaneously, the oldest summoned fey is instantly banished, so that the total number of summoned fey remains three.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["primal"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"lFGF4dzkscG7mbWq","name":"Mother Suit","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A matrona wears a massive suit made of stone, iron, and the souls of trapped fey creatures. As its mother suit is damaged, the matrona becomes smaller and more agile.</p>\n<p>When it is reduced to 200 Hit Points, the matrona becomes Huge. When reduced to 100 Hit Points, it becomes Large. For each size category reduced, the reach of the matrona's fist Strike reduces by 5 feet and the matrona's Speeds increase by 10 feet.</p>\n<p>@Compendium[battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-bestiary-effects.BchQoDFUAbgRSuxB]{Effect: Mother Suit (Huge)}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-bestiary-effects.sMqSzaJEVTxAGupz]{Effect: Mother Suit (Large)}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.7.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":1675727868867,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"G14XDf0kskzzqmMF","name":"Darkvision","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Darkvision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"darkvision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.qCCLZhnp2HhP3Ex6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"MHb8FSKRmvxj6XBC","name":"Fist","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["magical","reach-15"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"4niohyb7qpkx6rnyu2m5":{"damage":"3d12+17","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":28},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.7.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":1675727863546,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"Kgd4RgVEomwqPw3v","name":"Soul Beam","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["force","magical","range-increment-120"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"5ab0curx7aw76l4z9zqf":{"damage":"3d6+14","damageType":"force","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":24},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"nz6P9XM4ovKRX9dm","name":"Primal Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":25,"dc":33,"mod":0},"tradition":{"value":"primal"},"prepared":{"value":"innate","flexible":false},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":0},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"showUnpreparedSpells":{"value":true},"displayLevels":{}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"zkJ0BKdQzSh4K0QW","name":"Dominate","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/dominate.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You take command of the target, forcing it to obey your orders. If you issue an obviously self-destructive order, the target doesn't act until you issue a new order. The effect depends on its Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} as it fights off your commands.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You control the target. It gains the @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.9qGBRpbX9NEwtAAr]{Controlled} condition, but it can attempt a Will save at the end of each of its turns. On a success, the spell ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As a failure, but the target receives a new save only if you give it a new order that is against its nature, such as killing its allies.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (10th)</strong> The duration is unlimited.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"dominate","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","incapacitation","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":6},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"until the next time you make your daily preparations","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"nz6P9XM4ovKRX9dm","heightenedLevel":6},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.OsOhx3TGIZ7AhD0P","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"RgTD9YdtpThaLMFT","name":"Command","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/command.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You shout a command that's hard to ignore. You can command the target to approach you, run away (as if it had the @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} condition), release what it's holding, drop @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}, or stand in place. It can't Delay or take any reactions until it has obeyed your command. The effects depend on the target's Will save.</p>\n<hr /><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> For the first action on its next turn, the creature must use a single action to do as you command.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target must use all its actions on its next turn to obey your command.</p>\n<hr /><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures."},"rules":[],"slug":"command","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","concentrate","linguistic","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"until the end of the target's next turn","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"nz6P9XM4ovKRX9dm","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"5":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.aIHY2DArKFweIrpf","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"vYkFNLIS9l5yb3cc","name":"Charm","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/charm.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>To the target, your words are honey and your visage seems bathed in a dreamy haze. It must attempt a Will save, with a +4 circumstance bonus if you or your allies recently threatened it or used hostile actions against it.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss the spell. If you use hostile actions against the target, the spell ends. When the spell ends, the target doesn't necessarily realize it was charmed unless its friendship with you or the actions you convinced it to take clash with its expectations, meaning you could potentially convince the target to continue being your friend via mundane means.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected and aware you tried to charm it.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected but thinks your spell was something harmless instead of charm, unless it identifies the spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target's attitude becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.v66R7FdOf11l94im]{Friendly} toward you. If it was Friendly, it becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.v44P3WUcU1j0115l]{Helpful}. It can't use hostile actions against you.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target's attitude becomes Helpful toward you, and it can't use hostile actions against you.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations, and you can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"charm","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","emotion","incapacitation","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"nz6P9XM4ovKRX9dm","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"8":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.vLA0q0WOK2YPuJs6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"IgEd9EEUjAC2XN1p","name":"Glibness","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/glibness.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Falsehoods pass your lips as smoothly as silk. You gain a +4 status bonus to Deception checks to Lie and against Perception checks to discern if you are telling the truth, and you add your level even if you're untrained. If the implausibility of your lies prompts a circumstance penalty or a DC increase, reduce that penalty or increase by half.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"glibness","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"nz6P9XM4ovKRX9dm","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.JyxTmqjYYn63V5LY","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"WetYp4kParu7Nakq","name":"Suggestion","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/suggestion.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Your honeyed words are difficult for creatures to resist. You suggest a course of action to the target, which must be phrased in such a way as to seem like a logical course of action to the target and can't be self-destructive or obviously against the target's self-interest. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr /><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected and knows you tried to control it.\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected and thinks you were talking to them normally, not casting a spell on them.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target immediately follows your suggestion. The spell has a duration of 1 minute, or until the target has completed a finite suggestion or the suggestion becomes self-destructive or has other obvious negative effects.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the base duration is 1 hour.</p>\n<hr /><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures."},"rules":[],"slug":"suggestion","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","incapacitation","linguistic","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"varies","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"nz6P9XM4ovKRX9dm","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"8":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.qwlh6aDgi86U3Q7H","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"O2FNUvxK2eygxltG","name":"Telepathy 100 feet","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"telepathy","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","magical","mental"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kdhbPaBMK1d1fpbA","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"pf2e":{"lootable":false},"core":{}},"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":320,"temp":0,"max":320,"details":""},"ac":{"value":37,"details":"","base":37},"allSaves":{"value":"+1 status to saves vs. enchantment"},"speed":{"value":30,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","label":"Fly","value":30}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed"},{"type":"disease"},{"type":"doomed"},{"type":"drained"},{"type":"fatigued"},{"type":"healing"},{"type":"nonlethal-attacks"},{"type":"paralyzed"},{"type":"poison"},{"type":"sickened"},{"type":"unconscious"}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold-iron","value":15}],"resistances":[{"type":"physical","value":15,"exceptions":["bludgeoning"]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","fey"],"details":"telepathy 100 feet"},"level":{"value":15},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Matronas are small pixie-like fey creatures with squat bodies and twirled ears. One could be forgiven, though, for mistaking matronas for the magical constructs that they typically inhabit: hulking goliaths of iron and stone who can deliver a devastating punch and summon powerful fey to serve them.</p>\n<p>Matronas are envious of humans, large animals, and other creatures larger than themselves (which happens to be most of them). To compensate for their diminutive figures, matronas craft artificial bodies around themselves. Initially not much larger than the matrona itself, this \"mother suit\" provides a modicum of protection and stature. However, the suit is bolstered as the matrona within deceives and cons other fey creatures into building layer after layer on top of the original suit. Once a creature finishes the construction of a layer, the matrona binds the creature into the new layer using a complex ritual. In this way, a matrona is literally encapsulated by the combined efforts of countless indentured spirits.</p>\n<h2>Layer After Layer</h2>\n<p>A matrona's mother suit is made of interlocking layers that, when destroyed, release the spirits of the fey creatures trapped within. Disoriented and violent from years of imprisonment, these fey lash out at anything in their way. Once the fight is over, or they are destroyed, the distraught spirit is finally free to return to the fey realm.</p>\n<h2>Monster Part Subsystem</h2>\n<p><strong>Matrona Creature 15 </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 810/1,850/3,400 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), armor (heavy), shield, perception item, skill items (Athletics, Deception, Intimidation, Lore [Engineering], Nature)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, charisma, constitution, energy resistant (positive), evil, force, lawful, mental, sensory (darkvision), spells (Primal: charm, command, dominate, glibness, suggestion, summon fey), strength, sturdy, wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary","authors":"Tayrone Pereira","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":9},"dex":{"mod":5},"con":{"mod":8},"int":{"mod":4},"wis":{"mod":6},"cha":{"mod":8}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":23,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":29,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":24,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":25,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":32},"deception":{"base":31},"intimidation":{"base":29},"nature":{"base":27}},"traits":{"value":["construct","evil","fey","lawful"],"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"grg"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"prototypeToken":{"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"height":4,"width":4,"disposition":-1,"name":"Matrona","actorLink":false,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"bar2":{"attribute":null},"randomImg":false,"light":{"alpha":0.25,"angle":360,"bright":0,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"speed":5,"intensity":5,"type":null,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"color":null,"attenuation":0.5,"negative":false,"priority":0},"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/Tokens/matrona.webp","tint":"#ffffff","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"sight":{"angle":360,"enabled":false,"range":0,"brightness":1,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/Subjects/matrona.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":4},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1663517319095,"modifiedTime":1729380374217,"lastModifiedBy":"ZdvNMqfYMlbFrAL2","compendiumSource":"Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-bestiary.Actor.wzly2aM8jNCApDC6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}